tended to be directed by  quentin tarantino as well as one from  fargo and legion creator noah holly  while holly's project has been moved to  the back burner by paramount star trek  iv is reportedly full steam ahead one  division director matt shakman has  signed on to helm the project working  off a script from lindsay beer and  geneva robertson dwarit making this the  first star trek film to be penned by  women star trek 4 is set to hit theaters  on december 22nd 2023  although rumor has it that a third  sherlock holmes film has always been  part of the warner brothers plan things  have been a little slow recently since  robert downey jr has spent the past  decade anchoring the marvel cinematic  universe saving the world every couple  years is a draining gig and downey's  superhero commitments kept him from  being able to take on the detective role  for a third time  now that downey has finally exited the  mcu for good however he finally has the  time to team up with jude laws watson  for one more case the third sherlock  holmes film will be held by rocketman  director dexter fletcher a departure  from the first two films which were both  directed by guy ritchie meanwhile the  script comes from narcos creator chris  brancato while sherlock holmes 3 was  originally scheduled to release on  christmas day 2020 it's since been  delayed due to the uncertainty caused by  the kova 19 pandemic after having its  theatrical release bumped from 2020 to  december 21 2021 fletcher remarked in  the fall of 2020 that the sequel is  sitting in limbo until things get back  on track while the film obviously won't  make its christmas 2021 release at the  moment it's suspected that sherlock  holmes 3 will hit theaters sometime in  2022  disney's live action reimaginings of  their animated classics have proven to  be a home run at the box office and the  live action aladdin was no exception  bringing in over 1 billion dollars  globally so it comes at no surprise that  it's getting a follow-up although this  one likely won't be modeled directly off  the animated version of the animated  sequel few details are known about the  aladdin sequel although stars will smith  mina masood and naomi scott are all  expected to reprise their respective  roles as genie aladdin and jasmine guy  richie is also expected to return to the  director's chair working off a script  from john gattons and andrea burloff as  for the plot it's still very much an  unknown although it's possible that the  sequel could take the form of an  adaptation of another folk tale from  1001 nights aside from that though  everyone's still very much in the dark  on this one  before bad boys for life had even hit  theaters in early 2020 sony was already  prepping the fourth installment of the  bad boys franchise bad boys 4 was  announced in january 2020 as a follow-up  to the first three films in the hit  buddy cop action franchise which first  kicked off in 1995 with the original bad  boys starring will smith and martin  lawrence that original movie follows two  miami detectives as they investigate a  case of stolen heroine while protecting  the witness to a murder bad boys was  successful enough to earn a sequel which  was released in 2003 the third movie bad  boys for life catches up with detectives  lowry and burnett 17 years later as they  investigate a string of murders with  connections to lowry's past bad boys bad  boys what's she gonna do  what's she gonna do hey hey hey uh-uh no  no  never  no plot details have yet been revealed  about the fourth film but the script is  being penned by chris bremner who also  worked on bad boys for life while  nothing is official yet it's also safe  to assume that smith and lawrence will  both return for part four here's hoping  it doesn't take another 17 years to  release  despite having a pretty definitive  ending the oscar-nominated queen flick  bohemian rhapsody may be getting a  sequel the first film portrays the early  days of the iconic group from its  unsteady beginnings in 1970 when farooq  bolsara first joined through the next  few decades as bolsaro changes his name  to freddie mercury rises to fame and  eventually splits up the group in the  early 80s bohemian rap city ends with  the band reuniting for queen's  performance at live aid in 1985 before  explaining how mercury died of aids in  1991. there's no word yet on what the  plot of bohemian rhapsody 2 could be  whether it would delve into the last six  years of mercury's life or whether it  would follow the other members of the  band after his death in a post on  instagram live in 2021 queen guitarist  brian may said it's going to be hard to  follow bohemian rap city as none of us  could have predicted how massive that  was going to be but yes we are thinking  maybe it could happen but it would have  to be a great script it's going to take  a while to figure that out but as far as  whether the band has interest in a  sequel may said we are looking at it  yeah we have been looking at ideas  while 2021's cruella was set up to serve  as a prequel to disney's animated film  101 dalmatians by the time the end  credits rolled it was clear that there  was plenty more of cruella's story to  tell sure enough cruella 2 is now in the  works which will see emma stone  returning to the role of estella and her  ruthless alter ego cruella deville also  coming back as director craig gillespie  and writer tony mcnamara although none  of stone's fellow cruella cast members  are yet confirmed for the sequel the  first film saw aspiring fashion designer  and petty criminal estella scheming her  way to the top of the fashion industry  and usurping the reign of reigning  fashion queen baroness von hellman by  the end of the film cruella has claimed  the baroness's empire as her own and  fully embraced her dark and  semi-villainous persona yet she still  has a great love of dogs particularly  dalmatians which begs the question of  just how she transforms into the kind of  person who wants to skin them for her  coats perhaps we'll find out when  cruella 2 eventually struts into  theaters  producer and director phil lord has said  that the team behind the jump street  movies is putting a pin in 23 jump  street which would mark the third outing  for channing tatum and jonah hill  however the studio is moving forward  with a spin-off of the comedy franchise  this time focusing on a female crime  fighting duo the first two jump street  films follow a pair of male cops who go  undercover at educational institutions  in order to ferret out elusive drug  suppliers presumably the plot of jump  street now for her pleasure would be  much in the same vein it will also  probably exist in the same universe as  the existing jump street films  functioning as a continuation of the  story started by officers morton schmidt  and greg jenko in the first movies this  time the stars taking the fight to the  streets will be tiffany haddish and  zendaya who will most likely be playing  undercover narcotics officers similar to  tatum and hill's characters in the first  two movies after directing the first two  jump street films chris miller and phil  lord will be stepping aside for this  third outing with rodney rothman taking  the director's chair rosman will also be  collaborating on the script with bob's  burgers writers lizzie and wendy  molyneux rothman previously helped write  the screenplay for 22 jump street and  co-directed lord and miller's acclaimed  animated film spider-man into the  spider-verse sadly there's been no word  yet on what the plot will entail or  whether schmidt or jenko might make an  appearance  sylvester stallone and the expendables 4  have been engaging in a will they won't  they dance for a few years now but it's  finally official the muscle-bound gang  is getting back together again with  scott wah directing and spencer cohen  writing the script in addition to  stallone the expendables franchise has  been a veritable who's who of current  and former action superstars featuring  everyone from mel gibson to bruce willis  to jean-claude van damme to chuck norris  and many many many more  i'm back  this time around we know that stallone  and jason statham are coming back as are  dolph lundgren and ufc legend randy  couture a number of other stars  including megan fox and 50 cent have  also signed on to the film in  undisclosed roles plus the former holder  of the world's strongest man title eddie  hall has personally been offered a role  by stallone himself paul will play a  villain as will martial art star  ekoaways who will apparently be facing  off against statham's character in the  film of course these are still the early  days for the project so don't be  surprised to see more expendables  veterans return and a few other fresh  faces too  after the massive commercial success of  disney's photo realistic remake of the  lion king it seemed like only a matter  of time until a sequel was announced  however the director taking the  directorial reigns from john favreau for  the lion king 2 is probably not a name  most people would have expected to hear  barry jenkins this academy award-winning  writer and director is best known for  creating critically acclaimed dramas  with strong racial themes including  moonlight and if beale street could talk  jenkins won't be writing the lion king 2  but he'll be working from a script by  jeff nathanson who also penned the first  lion king while no specific details of  the plot have been revealed we know that  it will act as a prequel to the first  film following mufasa and scar in their  younger years it will also introduce a  number of new characters though who they  are and what animals they might be has  yet to be confirmed although the lion  king 2 seems like an outlier in jenkins  filmography the director sounds excited  about working on the sequel for disney  saying having the opportunity to work  with disney on expanding this  magnificent tale of friendship love and  legacy while furthering my work  chronicling the lives and souls of folk  within the african diaspora is a dream  come true  some films get theatrical or streaming  sequels while others get turned into tv  series but if you're the nicholas cage  series national treasure you get both  the long-awaited three cool to 2004's  national treasure and 2007's national  treasure book of secrets seems to  finally be moving forward at disney  tapping bad boy's forescribe chris  brumner to write the script but that's  not all national treasure will also find  new life as a disney plus tv series  which producer jerry bruckheimer says is  currently in the development process  while national treasure 3 is expected to  reunite the cast from the first two  films including cage himself the tv  series will follow a young woman named  jessie who embarks on an adventure to  uncover a lost pan-american treasure  serving as one of the executive  producers for the series is john  turtletown who helmed both of the first  two films and is expected to direct the  third although the disney plus series is  currently further along in the  development pipeline with production set  to start in early 2022 bruck armor says  he's hopeful that both projects will  ultimately come to fruition delivering a  veritable treasure trove of new national  treasure adventures  with the open-ended conclusion of the  2020 charlize theron action hit the old  guard it seemed as though the film was  begging for a sequel sure enough the old  guard 2 is in the works for netflix the  sequel will bring back star charlize  theron as andy the millennia-old  mercenary who in the first film realized  her immortality was finally beginning to  wane also returning will be marwan  kanzari and luca marinelli who played  joe nicky respectively the life partners  for centuries who also act as part of  andy's group production is set to start  in the first quarter of 2022 with  victoria mahoney attached to direct and  while no plot details have been released  yet the first film set up some  intriguing possibilities after betraying  the other members of their group and  being punished with a century of exile  the devious booker comes face to face  with quinn played by veronica no quinn  is a former member of their immortal  squad who they had thought was lost  forever at the bottom of the ocean i  feel her pain  her rage  she feels crazy  although quinn used to be andy's closest  ally centuries of drowning over and over  might just have changed her tune this  intriguing story thread will hopefully  be followed up when the old guard 2 hits  netflix sometime in the future  mere days after the 2021 chris pratt's  sci-fi action film the tomorrow award  dropped on amazon prime amazon studios  and skydance were already talking about  a sequel the first film centers around  pratt's character who's recruited as a  soldier to travel to the future and  fight war to save humanity the sequel  would reportedly bring back pratt and  the first movie's main cast along with  director chris mckay and writer zach  dean the tomorrow war earned an  enthusiastic reaction from amazon prime  subscribers who viewed it enough for it  to debut as the number one film across  streaming platforms over the july 4th  holiday weekend so it's no wonder that  the studios would be eagerly circling a  sequel although no specific plans are  confirmed yet and while we don't yet  know what the story of a potential the  tomorrow war ii would be it will  hopefully be just as thrilling and  action-packed as the first film  the long-running insidious franchise is  getting a fifth installment and this  time franchise star patrick wilson will  be settling into the director's chair  the first two films follow a couple  whose young son is haunted by  otherworldly beings while the third and  fourth are prequels that focus on the  psychic who aided the heroes of the  first two films insidious five will  follow the sun from the original movie  now a decade older as he heads off to  college in a statement regarding his  directorial duties on the fifth movie  wilson said i'm honored and thrilled to  be at the helm of the next insidious  installment which will provide an  amazing chance to unpack everything the  lamberts went through a decade ago as  well as deal with the consequences of  their choices into the further we go the  further that wilson is referring to is  the demonic realm that houses the  entities which haunt the characters in  the insidious films the script for  insidious five was penned by scott teams  and based on a story by lee winnell who  wrote the first four films in the  franchise  although the original tron wasn't much  of a hit when it was released in 1982  the movie developed a growing cult  following in the decades that followed  which ultimately proved big enough to  warrant a sequel tron legacy premiered  in 2010 starring garrett headland olivia  wilde and original tron star jeff  bridges tron legacy did well enough to  earn a sequel of its own and it runs in  the family writer jesse wigatau was  brought aboard in 2012 to pen the script  however disney reportedly couldn't  figure out how to best approach a new  installment in the tron series and so  the project was put on hold now the  third tron film appears to be moving  forward again with lion director garth  davis coming aboard to direct and jared  leto attached to star while davis is not  known for the type of big-budget  cgi-heavy filmmaking that a tron film  would require insiders say that he  fought hard for the job eventually  convincing disney executives that he was  the right person to bring the grid back  to life as for leto he may have  inadvertently revealed the title for the  third tron film in a now deleted tweet  confirming his casting referring to the  film as tron aries although the project  has yet to receive a green light davis  and leto's involvement may signal a  light at the end of the tunnel for this  long gestating three-quarter check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

